{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_gdglow_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_gdglow_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"純屬意外","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_gdglow_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"a8eb712881017e81794419670487c94448163fed4c4bc30ebbb947ad00720bbb","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"回卡拉頓看老朋友的澄閃在街頭刮開了一張號稱中獎率高達百分之八十的獎券，而她只想在中獎後為自己買個冰淇淋。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼~哼哼♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天花板夜空投影燈給夏櫟姐，信箱上的風鈴給風丸小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還差格拉尼小姐的、夜煙小姐的、天火小姐的……還有博士、阿米婭、凱爾希醫生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下就該去看看卡拉頓的工友們了。難得回一趟卡拉頓，不知道大家現在過得怎麼樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這張獎券。上面說最小的四獎也有二十鎊，中獎機率有80%……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們也真是的，一定到現場領獎不可。要不是我這次回卡拉頓看大家，就和二十鎊錯過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那邊的高級冰淇淋店是不是在促銷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吞口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應該不會那麼倒楣吧？等拿到二十鎊，就吃一球，就一球，吃吃味道就好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先刮開看看吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十……有了。後面還有零？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩百……兩千……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩萬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭獎，兩萬鎊？！"},{"type":"narration","text":"蘇茜揉了揉眼睛，把獎券對著陽光看了又看。\n刮開的部分清晰無誤地寫著“頭獎：兩萬鎊”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，這——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（壓低聲音）不不不不不不，我要冷靜，冷靜……這麼一大筆錢，就、就這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我馬上回辦事處找苦根先生，我們一起去兌獎處，馬上就去。"},{"type":"narration","text":"儘管心裡想的是羅德島辦事處，可不知不覺之中，雙腳已經把她帶到了冰淇淋店門前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰淇淋店店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，本店今天優惠大酬賓喔，一球八折，兩球五折！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那要是買兩球的話……我可以選兩個口味嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冰淇淋店店員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然可以！如果您想嘗試更多口味，我推薦更划算的十色桶……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"不行了，我也吃到頭痛了。這十色桶真的有夠大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，都確認是真的了，你就別翻來覆去看那張獎券了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"剛好洗髮精廠說他們財務下個月才回來，要到那時候才能兌獎，你趁這段時間好好規劃一下這筆錢該怎麼花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先把一半寄回家，一萬鎊應該足夠家裡換一個更大更漂亮的房子了，剩下的錢可以用來做點生意……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，呃……買一大堆理髮設備給羅德島？就連幫斑點先生理髮也能在十分鐘內解決戰鬥的那種？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"——噗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"還是多想想自己的生活吧。一萬鎊對一家公司來說不多，對一個人來說，足夠讓生活天翻地覆了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，車隊到了啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，忘了跟你說，我馬上要出差一段時間，差不多也是下個月回來，到時候我們一起去把獎領了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你接下來去哪？車隊說不定能順便載你一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去看看吉姆斯先生他們……或許，找家酒吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是沒問題，不過自從“綠意火花”出事之後，感染者社區的工人們就沒酒吧可以去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說外面有些酒吧會額外收錢偷偷放他們進去，我猜你這一回來，他們多半要拉你一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小心別暴露了，之前就有感染者暴露了身分，結果被裡面的醉漢打了一頓的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我會讓大家小心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"……蘇茜，你再說一遍，多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）兩萬鎊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"兩萬鎊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"小聲！你還嫌小火花身上事情不夠多嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）怪我怪我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）還是別在這裡聊這個了，太危險了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說，不是在我走之前就頒布了改善感染者工人待遇的法案嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法案是好的，但有些東西法案也改變不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算有法案，我們喝酒不也還是偷偷摸摸，跟做賊一樣嗎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，對不起，我不是故意要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，你等等，這人手裡是什麼……刀片？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可疑的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"*維多利亞粗口*，一身靜電的怪物！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不好意思，我們已經派人去追剛剛那傢伙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們送各位每人一杯特調，千萬不要因為那傢伙對我們酒吧產生什麼壞印象……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——等一下，我認出你了，就是你對來喝酒的感染者要錢要得最黑，上次不是還因為我錢不夠——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"酒保","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什麼啊！您沒必要這樣開玩笑，您怎麼可能是感染者……"},{"type":"narration","text":"沒人聽酒保解釋，可也沒人像平常那樣對感染者避之不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"竊竊私語的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"兩萬？真的假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"竊竊私語的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這不是撞破了貝希曼議員陰謀的那個蘇茜·格里特嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"竊竊私語的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有個遠房親戚前幾天買終端中了二十萬呢！聽說第二天就把工作辭了，去汐斯塔度假了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"竊竊私語的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"要不然這小妹妹為什麼專門搞了靜電裝置保護自己的錢包？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"竊竊私語的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"切，明明是個感染者，運氣倒是好，這筆錢要是給我……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"我們……趕快走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼啊，天亮了。昨晚做了好多惡夢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獎券……還在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，酒吧裡的一時失言，沒人會當回事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有很多時間慢慢想這些錢該怎麼花……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜小姐，羅德島的蘇茜·格里特小姐在嗎？你的信我放在信箱裡了，請注意查收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信？給我的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信使已經走了啊。讓我看看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！信箱裡怎麼一下子塞了這麼多信？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且……都是給我的？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“投資快訊：還在為大額資金難以打理煩惱嗎？高多汀公爵親自認證，維多利亞投資大師……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“蘇茜小姐，我和您一樣來自博森德爾，小時候還抱過您。您可能不記得我了……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“格里特小姐，請幫幫我們。我們在沸區投資的商店連年虧損，現在只需要一筆資金入股……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我不記得自己這麼有名啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“致城市英雄蘇茜·格里特小姐……欣聞格里特小姐回城，鄙人敬仰見義勇為之熱心人士，想請格里特小姐赴寒舍一聚……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只要我不上當就沒什麼好怕的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能讓這筆錢把我回卡拉頓的整個行程都攪亂了！我得振作起來，還有好多朋友沒見，還有好多禮物沒挑呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，得先把兌獎券鎖到更安全的地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，出門就已經中午了啊……送格拉尼小姐什麼比較好呢？武器保養油？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛乾淨的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是蘇茜·格里特小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛乾淨的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_701_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不用這麼戒備，我曾經在“綠意火花”和您有過一面之緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一家感染者酒吧。您真的去過嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就這個吧。格拉尼小姐一定會高興的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自來熟的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，一定是蘇茜吧！快來快來，我終於見到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……認識您嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"自來熟的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，感情可以慢慢培養。要喝點什麼嗎？我請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哭喪著臉的路人","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行行好，我家有四個孩子，我昨天被工廠踢了出來，我什麼都沒有了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是五鎊，你拿好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是趕快回辦事處吧，好像又有人要過來了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"鎖有被人動過的痕跡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"糟了，裡面都是羅德島的藥啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……還好，沒人進來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須把門關緊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？別、別進來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，是我，畢恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢恩先生？你也是來……借錢的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尷尬地清嗓子）我不是這個意思……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，不好意思啊，我替阿石向你道歉，我們給你造成了大麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒什麼，你們也不是故意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來找你，其實是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……想找你商量件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，既然你現在寬裕了，我們在想……能不能在原址上重建“綠意火花”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，本來就也不是我們的錢，我們不該有這種非分之想的。你好好休息吧。苦根呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……出差了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他快點回來吧。你一個小姑娘突然擔了這麼大的事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，現在說這話還有什麼意思呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢恩先生，重建“綠意火花”要多少錢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算算，地皮還在，不用額外交錢，給市政廳交一百鎊就可以開工。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣一來，連重建加上裝潢，大概……一千五六百鎊吧，加上給市政廳的錢，再算上些零零碎碎的，兩千鎊就差不多了，不會比這更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，你看……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那就建吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然是真的。我在羅德島上過得蠻好的，不如在生活被這筆錢搞得天翻地覆之前拿它來幫助大家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“這筆錢”？不，怎麼可能用那麼多？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題啦。你也看見外面的信箱了吧？總比和那些來路不明的傢伙打交道好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去跟大家說了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！快去吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"苦根先生！你回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"事情我聽說了，沒想到我走了半個月，事情就變成了這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼能叫“變成了這樣”呢？我覺得這樣很好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉姆斯先生現在每天都來跟我彙報進度，酒館這幾天應該快建好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……兩千鎊，畢恩報的倒是真實價格，甚至還把價格往下壓了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多現在也沒有了。獎金還沒拿到手，我手頭只有這兩千鎊，真的就只是重建“綠意火花”的成本，裡面連一個便士的工錢都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"工錢啊……我記得畢恩最後也沒和你提工錢到底怎麼算。這樣真的好嗎？你給自己的一萬鎊裡可能有一大筆要拿出來，剩不了太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，大家也都是因為生活太苦了，實在是沒有辦法。就算不重建“綠意火花”，我也應該用別的方式幫幫他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管是畢恩先生還是吉姆斯先生都不好意思跟我談工錢，但這本來就是大家應得的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己能想得通，那就最好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你這邊的房子都快蓋好了，洗髮精廠那邊的財務是不是也應該度完假回來了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroundF"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來領獎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，原來是蘇茜的朋友啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你們這麼開心，一定是中了筆大的對不對？真羡慕你們啊，就算是二獎，兩千鎊也能買好多想買的東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩千鎊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，兩千鎊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你說的話和獎券上刮出來的數字差太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？上面寫的多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"頭獎，兩萬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"頭獎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看……對，你拿著就好，我確認一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的沒錯，這就奇怪了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廠長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事？誰在門口吵吵鬧鬧的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廠長，這位小姐抽中了我們的頭獎，可是我記得頭獎不是在我休假前就兌出去了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廠長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？給我看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廠長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前兌的獎券在這裡……為什麼兩張獎券的編號一模一樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廠長","speakerId":"avg_npc_1256_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……一定是造假！快，快去報警，把這兩個騙子抓起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你這是什麼意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"財務","speakerId":"avg_npc_524_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對呀，蘇茜小姐是個踏實的人，之前還當了“城市英雄”，她怎麼會做這種事？"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩邊劍拔弩張，眼看就要爭執起來，然而在這之前，蘇茜先開了口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣……為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這下連畢恩先生他們的工錢都要付不起了……"},{"type":"narration","text":"蘇茜並沒有哭，但她無助的喃喃聲比哭聲更令人揪心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，苦根，還有蘇茜！你們來得剛好——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"畢恩，有件事我得跟你們說一下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼事能比我們手上的事還大？重建現在就差最後一步——把「綠意火花」的招牌重新掛上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，要不然你來掛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不、不了……我不能……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼突然這麼消沉，想起傷心事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，我、我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我去掛了！這可是殊榮，大家都搶著要做耶。"},{"type":"narration","text":"蘇茜跟著畢恩，一路走到“綠意火花”門前。\n小店整體上復原了失火前的花草燈藝店。在原有的格局之外，酒吧裡還專門開闢了一個角落，擺放著鏡子、轉椅和各種理髮用品。\n門面上的燙金字閃閃發光，整個建築都散發著剛剛裝修完畢的獨特香氣。\n畢恩爬上梯子，小心翼翼地把“綠意火花”的招牌掛好，四周爆發出掌聲和歡呼聲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣我們終於不用再去外面的酒吧受人白眼了！“綠意火花”萬歲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者區工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"萬歲！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"蘇茜打量著重新建成的花草燈藝店，兼酒吧，兼理髮店。\n它明明應該是自己新生活的開始。\n要不然，它也應該是更多人生活的助力。\n可是為什麼，為什麼總是這樣？\n聽著身旁人群的歡呼，她鼻子忽然一酸，眼前原本清晰的景象一下子模糊起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，大家都知道你在這個地方有些不好的回憶，可是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚嗚嗚……哇啊啊啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，哭得越來越傷心了……這到底怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獎券……廠長說是假的，明明就不是……明明應該有兩萬鎊的，我的積蓄，大家的生活……嗚嗚……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"獎券？假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"苦根，我聽你剛剛也跟畢恩說有事，到底怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"洗髮精廠不給蘇茜兌獎。他們說頭獎已經被人領走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有這種事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"很顯然是那個廠長偽造獎券內定了獲獎人選，忘了做足準備，結果出岔了。可是他們現在咬死說是印刷錯誤，不願意付錢給蘇茜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"他們還真敢？“前途”洗髮精廠不就在感染者區南邊嗎？蘇茜一開始買他們家的洗髮精，不也是因為他們說會支持感染者區嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"他們廠長原來就是這樣支持我們的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"走，我們討個說法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者區工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，大家有不少是感染者，就這麼去工廠，是不是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼，不是還有我們嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我們又不鬧事，我們就跟那個廠長說一聲，要是連張獎券都兌不出來，就沒人再買他們的洗髮精，也沒人再幫他工作了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"當時卡拉頓不是還發了個“城市英雄”的獎給蘇茜嗎，他們就這麼對他們封的英雄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，別傷心了，走，我們一起過去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"我們再次向蘇茜·格里特小姐，還有關心格里特小姐的人道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"這件事的確令人生疑，但誰也沒有確鑿的證據來證明廠長黑箱作業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"市政廳官員","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"他同意補償格里特小姐兩千維鎊，還有兩車“前途”牌洗髮精。此事到此為止，也請各位不要再節外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"你等等，這件事還——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者區工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，*維多利亞粗口*，說白了還是不拿我們感染者區的人當人看。要是哪個議員老爺身上出了這種事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，再說也沒用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼樣，至少比什麼都沒有好多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我們之前欠你的酒錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"那……這件事終於辦完，我們就先回去了。抱歉啊蘇茜，給你造成了麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後有什麼事記得叫我們來幫忙啊！我先走了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸……欸？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉姆斯先生、阿石哥、畢恩先生——大家先等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？怎麼了，還有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，大家的工錢……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"工錢？畢恩說他那天找你的時候都和你聊完了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是說，我本來應該從兩萬鎊裡拿出一大部分作為工錢發給大家的，大家可以用這些錢改善生活，不用再過得那麼拮据……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在只有兩千鎊了，我實在是也拿不出更多錢，只能先把這兩千鎊分給大家……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，不對不對不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"畢恩，你那天怎麼跟蘇茜說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那個，蘇茜說，“不如在生活被這筆錢攪得天翻地覆之前拿它來幫助大家”，我就說“怎麼可能用那麼多”……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"就沒了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就……沒了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"畢恩，你這個混球，怎麼連個話都說不清楚！這不就變成讓蘇茜看著給的意思了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"重建“綠意火花”不是蘇茜起的頭，但錢都是她出的！就這樣你也好意思提“工錢”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，我怎麼可能好意思提工錢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"你還嘴硬！你看看這件事被你辦成這樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我錯了，我錯了，我向蘇茜道歉，也向大家道歉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者阿石","speakerId":"avg_npc_002","isRemote":false,"text":"道歉哪夠，至少要給“綠意火花”做一個月白工！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者區工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"對啊！對啊！"},{"type":"narration","text":"感染者區的工人們半真半假地鬧作一團。\n苦根看向蘇茜，剛剛還寫在她臉上的難過和歉疚並未完全散去，但更多的已經是快樂和溫暖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家等下，我還是覺得——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜，這次大家才不聽你的。要是你還想給我們錢，我們就要把你和畢恩打成同黨了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，再怎麼說也不能讓大家做白工——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"苦根","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"蘇茜。現在就先把這件事放下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，吉姆斯先生，能不能麻煩你把轉椅、鏡子和理髮工具搬出來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工人吉姆斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是可以……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼多洗髮精根本就運不走，不如在這裡幫大家好好理理髮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說我看你們亂蓬蓬的頭髮不順眼好久了！畢恩先生，打白工就算了，接下來你給我乖乖坐在這裡，聽到了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者畢恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_329_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者區工人們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是不是太便宜他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇茜","speakerId":"avg_377_gdglow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們也別覺得自己逃得掉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
